OL,3,GNEWSA'Anger' over theatre and hospital
OL,4,Abuilding delays
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere is increasing frustration over
OL,7,Fdelays to a town's multimillion-pound
OL,8,Fredevelopment projects including a
OL,9,Ftheatre and hospital, councillors have
OL,10,Fsaid.
OL,12,FA new high school for Berwick in
OL,13,FNothumberland has also been in the
OL,14,Fpipeline for several years and there
OL,15,Fare worries the project has gone
OL,16,Fmillions of pounds over budget.
OL,18,FLabour MP for north Northumberland
OL,19,FDavid Smith, said there was "palpable
OL,20,Fanger" among teachers and parents about
OL,21,Fthe "lack of progress".
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
