OL,3,GNEWSA'Anger' over theatre and hospital
OL,4,Abuilding delays
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorthumberland County Council said the
OL,7,Fschool rebuild was ultimately the
OL,8,Fresponsibility of the Deparment for
OL,9,FEducation. The department has been
OL,10,Fapproached for comment.
